;
; How Mercer files one product of its catalogue in MYRA (mercer_rules.h
; MR5): a tree kept as a sparse record under the product's category and
; its own code, with its price in minor units (MR2's answer) and the
; units in stock (MR1's answer). The model asks whether the numbers fit
; before it keeps the product.
^ZXMERCER(category:i4, product:i6) = price:i15! ^ stock:i9!
